WEBVTT

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:02.456
JM: You are like young girls becoming

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:06.416
what they always dreamed
of becoming when they grew up.

00:12:06.440 --> 00:12:09.376
FB: When a sister loves a sister,

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:12.016
you listen to her read, thinking --

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:16.600
JM: As heaven to the gods
is poetry to the beloved.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:21.416
(Applause)

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:22.656
JM: Love you.

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:28.360
(Applause)